# Store every file byte-for-byte: no CRLF/LF translation, ever.
#
# This repo is a restore point for a game mod, not a source tree. Half of it is
# binary with no source (mod.ff, the sound banks, .iwi images, .glb models) and
# several files carry no extension at all (attachmentunique/au_*), which Git
# would otherwise have to guess about. A line-ending rewrite on the wrong file
# produces a mod that builds and then misbehaves in game for no visible reason.
# Checking out any commit must give back exactly what was committed.
* -text
